### 540-free-shipping-threshold.http — [usecase-test] CASE-02. (Order) 상품 합계가 50000이면 배송비가 무료가 된다
### https://github.com/prgrms-be-adv-devcourse/beadv7_7_earlybird_BE/issues/540
###
### 상품 합계 50000(경계값, 무료배송) vs 49999(배송비 3000) 두 케이스를 리워드 두 개로 나눠 검증한다.

### 1~9. 창작자 준비 (회원가입/로그인/전환/토큰갱신/카테고리/프로젝트/승인) — 다른 use-case 파일과 동일 패턴
< {%
    client.global.set("creatorEmail", "ord540-creator-" + Date.now() + "@earlybird.co.kr");
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{creatorEmail}}", "password": "rawPassword1!", "name": "540창작자", "phoneNumber": "010-1000-0003"}

> {% client.assert(response.status === 200, "signup failed: " + response.body); %}

### 2. 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{creatorEmail}}", "password": "rawPassword1!"}

> {%
    client.global.set("creatorAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.global.set("creatorRefreshToken", response.body.data.refreshToken);
%}

### 3. 창작자 전환
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/creator
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bankCode": "88", "accountNumber": "110-540-000001", "accountHolder": "540창작자"}

> {% client.assert(response.status === 200, "register as creator failed: " + response.body); %}

### 4. 토큰 재발급
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken": "{{creatorRefreshToken}}"}

> {% client.global.set("creatorAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 5. 카테고리 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/project-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorAccessToken}}

> {% client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.data[0].id); %}

### 6. 프로젝트 등록
< {%
    const now = new Date();
    const endAt = new Date(now.getTime() + 30 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);
    request.variables.set("startAt", now.toISOString().slice(0, 19));
    request.variables.set("endAt", endAt.toISOString().slice(0, 10));
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "540 배송비 경계값 테스트", "categoryId": {{categoryId}}, "summary": "CASE-02", "description": "540-free-shipping-threshold.http", "goalAmount": 1000000, "startAt": "{{startAt}}", "endAt": "{{endAt}}"}

> {% client.global.set("projectId", response.body.data.projectId); %}

### 7. 리워드 A 등록 — 가격 50000 (무료배송 경계값)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/rewards
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "무료배송 경계 리워드", "description": "50000원", "price": 50000, "totalQuantity": 5}

> {% client.global.set("rewardIdFree", response.body.data.rewardId); %}

### 8. 리워드 B 등록 — 가격 49999 (배송비 3000 부과)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/rewards
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "배송비 부과 리워드", "description": "49999원", "price": 49999, "totalQuantity": 5}

> {% client.global.set("rewardIdPaid", response.body.data.rewardId); %}

